## Troubleshooting

- `Failed to connect to bus` or `System has not been booted with systemd`: your environment is not using systemd (some containers and WSL setups). Use a full Ubuntu VM.
- `Permission denied` on `ExecStart`: run `chmod +x` on the script and check the path.
- Changes not taking effect: you forgot `sudo systemctl daemon-reload`.
- Service exits immediately: check `journalctl -u <name> -n 20`.

